yV-jCaO5pJpP9rquYLYCJhyo0hgLPYkwyjmJQ6-2QMMj48dC_rizars&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3EA9nT4xCnZgKhy_-NgT7qMYTgAlchfV7vi9FTucYe1A&oe=69F0A241"}, "display_name": "Virtual City Arcade", "keywords": ["arcade", "sports", "basketball", "hockey", "physics"], "long_description": "### **WELCOME TO THE 100TH FLOOR**\nStep into your private arcade penthouse located 100 stories above the city; a dedicated space to play your favorite physics-based classic arcade games designed to be played exactly like their real-world counterparts.\n### **THE GAMES**\nYou aren't just pressing buttons; you're using your hands to throw basketballs, roll balls, and move your paddle. Experience tactile, 1:1 interactions that make every movement in the game matter.\n\n- **City Hoops:** Aim and throw for the hoop with realistic basketball physics.\n{1169871302866477}\n- **Puck Strike:** Grab the paddle and test your reaction time in Air Hockey against the AI.\n{1768711684090617}\n- **Ring Sink:** Master the precision and strength needed to sink balls into high-value ring targets.\n{1659352088738386}\n### **THE ARCADE PENTHOUSE**\nYour private arcade is open 24/7, designed with a minimalistic, upscale aesthetic to make you elevated and thrilled while you play. Floor-to-ceiling windows offer panoramic views of the city skyline, providing a stunning backdrop to your gaming sessions.\n{1299921815397370}\n### **COMFORT & PLAYSTYLE**\n- **Accessibility:** Built for comfort. The Virtual City Arcade uses simple teleportation to move between machines.\n- **Play Position:** Can be played comfortably while standing or in a stationary position.\n- **Competition:** Challenge your friends or family to see who can claim the top score.\n", "short_description": "Welcome to your 100th-floor arcade penthouse. Enjoy stunning city views while playing your favorite physics-based classics. Will you claim the top score?"}]}, "developer_name": "Yonuel Interactive", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "h